config BR2_PACKAGE_CE_SCREENSAVER
	bool "ce-screensaver"
	help
	  HDMI screen saver for the CosmosEx: a spinning, bouncing
	  Atari logo after a while without activity, then the HDMI
	  output switched off. Wakes on console input and on USB input
	  used by the Atari (reported by the CosmosEx app).
